 "_comment": "The public master insert .plg set of poly-effects-os: one row per insert. Sources and includes are relative to src/synth-open/ (their tracker-ff path synth-open/), the Dirt kernel ff_dirt.cpp and ff_dirt_ctl.cpp is the firmware's own (vendored in sdk/files/, the plugin must sound like the built-in Dirt). plg_opt and plg_src_opt are the build_plug.py flags (the tracker-ff 1.2.0 release flags, so the .plg is byte identical to it). nondefault: emu_plug.py arguments that move every parameter and change one in block 5. emu_checksum and emu_checksum_nondefault: the output checksums of sdk/files/synth-open/plug/emu_plug.py at the three plugin homes (SRAM_L, FlexNVM + heap, SDRAM), equal to the 1.2.0 release build. Dirt's 3b1f3dc5 is the device rule (the in-image Dirt gives it). licence, licence_files, notice_section: what ships next to the binary (notice_section = a section of src/synth-open/plug/fx/NOTICE.md). The plug_id and version must equal the row of the same id in tracker-ff engines/engines.json.",
